घड्याळ
=== start/en
¶A localized clock in one line of code. @Now ticks a new @Moment every second, and \आता(
) → ''\ converts each one to text in your locale, calendar, and time zone, so the clock changes language when your locale does. Try giving @Now a frequency, time zone, and calendar, like \आता(
	1s
	'Asia/Tokyo'
	'japanese'
)\.¶
वाक्यांश(आता() → '' चेहरा: 'Doto')
